WEBVTT

00:10.280 --> 00:11.440
The cochlea.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.360
It's the organ inside the ear
that detects sounds.

00:14.800 --> 00:16.240
What it all boils down to is,

00:16.360 --> 00:19.280
it's likely the most noticeable
spiral in the human body.

00:21.800 --> 00:24.120
Mrs. Saito,
you seem to be improving.

00:24.400 --> 00:26.920
Yes, doctor,
I feel much better now.

00:27.360 --> 00:29.680
Are you still frightened
by the thought of spirals ?

00:29.920 --> 00:31.480
Oh, yes. Terrified.

00:31.960 --> 00:34.640
I'm sorry to hear that.
Let's try this, then.

00:35.400 --> 00:38.280
I'll refer you to Midoriyama-city's
psychiatric hospital.

00:40.200 --> 00:43.360
Isn't that a hospital for...
Shuichi.

00:43.960 --> 00:45.800
Do you have concerns
about going there ?

00:46.480 --> 00:49.720
Is it perhaps the stigma of being
in a "psychiatric" hospital ?

00:50.280 --> 00:52.840
Rest assured, you have
nothing to worry about.

00:53.200 --> 00:56.640
I was reminded by the hospital
director's anatomical chart.

00:57.880 --> 01:00.680
My mother shaved her head
and cut off her fingertips.

01:00.840 --> 01:02.480
Now that she's convinced
she's gotten rid

01:02.640 --> 01:04.280
of every trace of spiral on her body,

01:04.440 --> 01:06.760
imagine if she knew about
the spirals in her ears !

01:09.160 --> 01:11.200
Damn it !
It's another mosquito swarm !

01:12.040 --> 01:14.720
Male mosquitoes form a swarm
as part of their mating behavior.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.200
It's spiral-shaped.

01:16.600 --> 01:18.920
Now that you mention it,
I've seen a lot of those.

01:19.280 --> 01:21.600
Is that why there have been so many
mosquitoes lately ?

01:22.120 --> 01:24.400
It's the curse.
It's the curse of the spiral.

01:30.280 --> 01:31.600
Another ambulance !

01:32.360 --> 01:34.960
More than 10 pregnant women
were admitted just this morning.

01:35.200 --> 01:38.080
Claiming they feel sick after
suffering thousands of mosquito bites.

01:39.040 --> 01:42.000
Ms. Goshima ?
The maternity ward is too full.

01:42.280 --> 01:44.480
- We need you to share your room.
- Sure, of course.

01:46.120 --> 01:47.200
Keiko ?

01:48.040 --> 01:50.680
- Do you know her ?
- Yes, she's my cousin !

01:56.240 --> 01:58.720
- Thank you, Kirie.
- Don't mention it.

02:01.440 --> 02:04.120
Keiko, what's this ?
It's pretty heavy...

02:05.440 --> 02:08.000
- You can just put that in the dresser.
- Sure.

02:54.640 --> 02:57.080
My ! This patient, he's dead !

02:57.400 --> 02:59.840
- There are two more dead over here !
- What, two ?!

02:59.920 --> 03:01.040
What happened to them ?!

03:02.840 --> 03:05.200
They seem to be completely
covered in stab wounds.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.760
Yes. Whatever the cause,

03:07.880 --> 03:10.240
their bodies appear to be
completely drained of blood.

03:10.680 --> 03:12.120
We need to call the police !

03:12.880 --> 03:13.840
Were they murdered ?

03:14.760 --> 03:16.440
I didn't hear anything
last night, did you ?

03:16.960 --> 03:19.640
The only thing I can remember
hearing was mosquitoes buzzing.

03:23.120 --> 03:27.000
I can't believe there were murders
here ! And three of them ! Right ?

03:27.720 --> 03:31.040
Guess what happened, Kirie.
Baby's started to move around a bit.

03:31.440 --> 03:32.600
Really ?

03:32.920 --> 03:35.560
- Kirie, how do you feel ?
- Shuichi !

03:40.320 --> 03:43.280
Another mosquito !
You're not getting a drop out of me !

03:43.960 --> 03:45.000
Shuichi !

03:48.760 --> 03:50.000
Kirie, did you know ?

03:50.560 --> 03:53.280
Only female mosquitoes that
are carrying eggs suck blood.

03:53.760 --> 03:55.800
They gorge themselves
on the blood of animals

03:56.200 --> 03:58.120
to nurture the eggs
in their bellies.

03:59.840 --> 04:02.960
What are you doing ?!
You need to leave ! Now !

04:03.800 --> 04:07.840
I'm so sorry, Keiko ! Lately,
he's been acting a little bit strange.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.320
It's alright, Kirie.

04:14.840 --> 04:17.800
Keiko ? Try not to let
the mosquitoes bite you, okay ?

04:18.240 --> 04:21.960
Thanks, Kirie. But it's totally fine.
I don't mind mosquitoes.

04:23.880 --> 04:27.200
I actually like them.
I like them a lot.

05:24.760 --> 05:26.080
What are they doing ?

05:48.400 --> 05:51.120
You shouldn't be here !

06:02.360 --> 06:03.840
What's all the racket ?!

06:14.120 --> 06:15.280
Get away !

06:19.040 --> 06:23.200
Your blood !
Give us your blood !

06:30.840 --> 06:33.160
What's all this commotion ?
What's going on ?

06:37.080 --> 06:38.800
Give us blood !

06:48.080 --> 06:52.560
- I think that's enough for tonight.
- That was delicious !

06:52.680 --> 06:56.720
- Time to go back to our rooms.
- Right, let's get some sleep.

06:56.920 --> 06:58.120
Not so fast !

06:59.800 --> 07:03.600
You think you can just steal a peek
at our secret and simply walk away ?

07:14.320 --> 07:16.680
Stop it !
Help me, Keiko, please !

07:22.480 --> 07:26.080
- Blood... Give me all of your blood !
- Keiko...

07:37.000 --> 07:38.360
Die !

08:08.880 --> 08:13.120
My love...
Become one with me in the spiral !

08:13.480 --> 08:14.760
No. Never !

08:16.080 --> 08:21.000
How I would love to crawl into
that spiral in your ear, darling !

08:21.440 --> 08:24.600
I want to curl up in it
and fall asleep !

08:36.920 --> 08:40.640
- I saw it with my own eyes !
- That seems a bit far-fetched...

08:40.720 --> 08:42.480
Are you sure you weren't
just having a nightmare ?

08:42.600 --> 08:46.040
No, I'm serious ! Those pregnant
women were drinking blood !

08:53.240 --> 08:55.320
Your father
said something strange.

08:55.440 --> 08:58.000
Something about there being
spirals in my ears.

08:58.240 --> 09:01.120
But dad is dead !
It was only a dream, Mom.

09:02.680 --> 09:06.280
I have to make sure !
I have to look at that chart myself !

09:06.360 --> 09:07.480
Mom, please !

09:07.760 --> 09:10.040
Doctor ! My...

09:11.000 --> 09:13.000
Gone ! That chart is gone !

09:13.800 --> 09:16.000
That was too out of date,
so I got rid of it.

09:16.080 --> 09:19.840
You did what ?! Alright, then you'll
just have to tell me yourself !

09:19.960 --> 09:22.680
Don't you lie to me doctor,
is there a spiral hidden in my ear ?

09:22.920 --> 09:25.600
A spiral ? Of course not,
how could there be ?

09:26.560 --> 09:27.640
Is that true ?

09:27.760 --> 09:31.200
More importantly, Mrs. Saito,
those cuts on your feet must hurt.

09:31.800 --> 09:34.160
- Give her something for the pain.
- Right away, Doctor.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.760
Why don't we head back
to your room, Mrs. Saito ?

09:39.440 --> 09:41.560
Is it true ? Is it really true ?

09:56.440 --> 09:58.280
No... Please, no !

10:00.000 --> 10:01.800
They're in your ears !

10:03.000 --> 10:06.720
Inside your ears !

10:17.320 --> 10:19.960
Spirals inside your ears !

10:20.760 --> 10:24.640
He's in my ears ! He crawled
into the spirals in my ears !

10:25.760 --> 10:27.760
I have to hurry.
Have to get him out...

10:35.800 --> 10:38.640
For a moment, I thought we dodged
a bullet when I took that chart down.

10:39.040 --> 10:41.720
I believe we need to have
a specialist look at her right away.

10:41.960 --> 10:43.000
Yeah.

10:47.960 --> 10:49.440
Why is everything spinning ?

10:49.840 --> 10:52.360
My body keeps twisting 'round
and 'round...

10:53.000 --> 10:56.560
No !
I don't want to become a spiral !

11:17.400 --> 11:18.480
Those look like...

11:35.360 --> 11:38.120
- Thanks, I think I'm full now.
- But you barely touched it !

11:38.680 --> 11:42.720
I'm not a fan of these mushrooms.
They kind of smell like blood to me.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.560
Those mushrooms are delicious,
aren't they ?

11:49.080 --> 11:52.120
Our obstetrician, Dr. Kawamoto,
said that they're good for us,

11:52.200 --> 11:53.800
so we can eat
as much as we desire !

11:54.240 --> 11:56.840
You don't have to convince me !
I'd eat them anyway.

12:03.680 --> 12:05.120
I wonder what's going on...

12:07.440 --> 12:11.000
I can't wait to go back !
All the way back to the warm place !

12:11.480 --> 12:14.000
- Can we go back, though ?
- Sure, we can !

12:14.360 --> 12:16.280
That man took us out,
he can put us back.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.920
Bet he's putting Makio
back inside right now !

12:19.600 --> 12:23.000
- I hope I get to go back next !
- Me too, I can't wait !

12:26.640 --> 12:28.000
You're so naughty !

12:31.880 --> 12:33.120
That was Keiko's voice !

12:34.040 --> 12:35.160
In here !

12:48.080 --> 12:51.120
Dr. Kawamoto !
I heard Keiko scream just now !

12:51.360 --> 12:53.080
A baby's cuteness is a weapon

12:53.160 --> 12:56.240
that allows it to safely
mature into independence.

12:57.160 --> 13:00.680
They're determined little ones.
I keep cutting their umbilical cords

13:00.760 --> 13:03.120
and yet they continue
regenerating the placenta.

13:03.760 --> 13:07.680
They regrow the placenta at the very
end of their umbilical cords.

13:08.000 --> 13:11.640
That's how determined they are
to return to their beloved womb.

13:11.880 --> 13:13.680
Their preferred existence.

13:14.360 --> 13:18.200
Those mushroom-like things with
the spiral patterns all over them...

13:18.720 --> 13:20.640
Yes. They're placentas.

13:21.400 --> 13:25.080
They started growing spontaneously as
we were delivering them in this room.

13:43.840 --> 13:44.880
Keiko !

13:45.040 --> 13:47.920
Doctor, please...
I need blood !

13:49.720 --> 13:51.120
What are you doing ? Let go !

13:51.200 --> 13:53.120
Right now !
I need blood now !

14:05.000 --> 14:08.360
Delicious... So delicious...

14:15.080 --> 14:17.120
- So many mushrooms !
- Look at them all !

14:20.360 --> 14:25.200
More... I need more !

14:28.800 --> 14:31.720
Thank you for everything.
Take care of yourself, okay ?

14:32.680 --> 14:35.440
- Come on ! Let's go !
- You're hurting me !

14:39.000 --> 14:41.160
We're having Kirie's
welcome home party tonight !

14:41.480 --> 14:42.920
We hope to see you there,
Shuichi.

14:43.880 --> 14:45.120
Party ?! Yeah !

14:46.440 --> 14:48.880
Your house is located right
next to Dragonfly Pond !

14:49.280 --> 14:51.840
Which has become completely
contaminated with spirals !

14:51.920 --> 14:54.080
Party ! Let's go !

14:55.680 --> 14:58.600
- Welcome home, Kirie !
- Yeah, welcome home, Sis !

14:59.080 --> 15:00.240
Thank you...

15:00.320 --> 15:02.800
Shuichi, don't be shy !
Go ahead, dig in !

15:03.400 --> 15:05.280
OK, thank you very much.

15:09.680 --> 15:11.320
You must have been starving !

15:11.880 --> 15:14.080
Shuichi,
you should come by more often.

15:19.120 --> 15:20.480
What's the matter, Shuichi ?

15:22.040 --> 15:24.000
You can see it too,
can't you, Shuichi ?

15:24.640 --> 15:26.080
I'm quite proud of that piece !

15:26.480 --> 15:28.880
Your father was a man
who truly understood art !

15:29.240 --> 15:31.560
He came and spoke to me
before he passed away,

15:31.640 --> 15:33.680
and said pottery's
the art of the spiral.

15:33.960 --> 15:37.000
His words opened my eyes
to what true art is !

15:39.480 --> 15:41.920
As the typhoon approaches
landfall in Japan...

15:42.960 --> 15:45.160
Poor Shuichi
didn't eat very much, did he ?

15:45.800 --> 15:48.160
Yeah...
They're super creepy.

15:49.080 --> 15:51.320
All he's been making
is that weird stuff, lately.

16:04.560 --> 16:05.640
A face...

16:11.000 --> 16:13.720
Those faces look
like Shuichi's mom and dad...

16:20.760 --> 16:22.040
Shuichi !

16:25.920 --> 16:27.840
I need to see the inside
of that kiln !

16:28.080 --> 16:30.000
Shuichi, how long
have you been there ?

16:30.080 --> 16:34.320
They're calling to me. Someone's calling
out to me from inside that kiln !

16:35.320 --> 16:37.640
Don't be ridiculous,
that's impossible.

16:37.880 --> 16:39.000
Shuichi !

16:40.160 --> 16:44.000
Help us, Shuichi !
Shuichi !

16:44.760 --> 16:48.040
How ?! How can my mom
and dad be inside that kiln ?!

16:59.120 --> 17:00.280
Shuichi !

17:03.680 --> 17:04.800
Shuichi !

17:09.640 --> 17:11.000
I'll call the fire department !

17:21.320 --> 17:25.160
This powerful typhoon, which emerged
at such an unusual time...

17:26.640 --> 17:29.840
Dad, come down ! It's too dangerous
to be up there right now !

17:29.960 --> 17:31.040
I'm done !

17:44.480 --> 17:48.480
This monstrous typhoon has stalled
out right above Kurouzu-Town...

17:48.600 --> 17:51.720
... and fierce winds continue
to relentlessly batter that town.

17:52.160 --> 17:55.120
The Japan Meteorological Agency
remains puzzled...

17:55.560 --> 17:58.680
I'm reporting to you
live from Kurouzu-Town.

17:58.760 --> 18:02.000
Kobayashi ? We're seeing something
on the utility pole behind you.

18:02.160 --> 18:04.120
What ? The utility pole ?

18:06.000 --> 18:09.480
Could that possibly be a victim
caught by the typhoon's force ?

18:10.000 --> 18:11.880
Are you there ?
Kobayashi, are you there ?

18:11.960 --> 18:13.120
Yes ! I'm still here !

18:13.600 --> 18:17.120
What's going on ? It's just been
hovering here for nearly two hours !

18:17.240 --> 18:18.960
Not even
the The Agency knows why !

18:19.320 --> 18:20.680
Kirie...

18:21.720 --> 18:23.800
- What was that ?
- I don't know.

18:29.560 --> 18:31.840
It's the eye of the storm !
The eye is looking for you.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.880
- You have to see this, Sis !
- Don't be a weirdo, Mitsuo.

18:35.120 --> 18:38.640
It's called the eye of the storm,
but storms don't actually have eyes.

18:40.720 --> 18:43.000
Kirie...

18:43.960 --> 18:45.040
Coming !

18:46.120 --> 18:48.880
- Shuichi ?!
- Kirie ! Come with me !

18:56.960 --> 18:59.760
If you stay, your house and your
family will both be destroyed !

19:02.160 --> 19:04.000
Look ! That's the eye of the storm !

19:04.200 --> 19:06.160
Do you see those ominous,
swirling clouds ?

19:06.480 --> 19:08.760
Haven't you heard it ?
It's been calling your name !

19:09.160 --> 19:13.200
Like love at first sight ! This typhoon
is completely obsessed with you !

19:13.680 --> 19:16.200
- Are you serious ?
- Hurry ! This way !

19:29.000 --> 19:31.400
- Kirie !
- My leg ! I'm stuck !

19:31.720 --> 19:35.080
- You can't move ? Damn it !
- Are you okay ?!

19:36.440 --> 19:37.640
Hang on, I'll help you !

19:46.800 --> 19:48.960
She was swallowed
by the eye of the storm !

19:49.200 --> 19:50.240
Why ?!

20:00.320 --> 20:02.480
Kirie...

20:12.760 --> 20:15.920
The storm must have taken her,
mistaking her for me...

20:16.560 --> 20:20.120
If the storm stays here much longer
the whole town will be...

20:31.360 --> 20:32.440
Get down !

20:36.120 --> 20:37.240
This way !

21:27.160 --> 21:31.000
The powerful typhoon that caused
tremendous damage to Kurouzu-Town

21:31.120 --> 21:33.000
has mysteriously disappeared.

21:33.880 --> 21:36.200
This sudden vanishing
remains unexplained.

21:37.920 --> 21:41.640
- Did you hear that ?
- It's mice ! I'm so sick of them.

21:42.120 --> 21:45.000
If you believe the stories,
these houses predate the Meiji era !

21:45.680 --> 21:49.160
I wonder how a crude row house like
this wasn't destroyed by the typhoon.

21:49.560 --> 21:51.320
I guess it's a lot tougher
than it looks !

21:57.080 --> 21:58.480
It's him ! The monster !

21:59.680 --> 22:02.680
I knew the rumors were true !
I heard that a monster lives here !

22:02.760 --> 22:05.040
Every night, the monster
eats the neighborhood dogs !

22:05.120 --> 22:08.640
How can you say such an awful thing ?
Monsters aren't real, sweetheart.

22:08.880 --> 22:11.880
It's true ! They say a whole bunch
have already been eaten !

22:14.120 --> 22:15.160
Coming !

22:15.240 --> 22:17.000
Mrs. Goshima ?
It's me, your neighbor.

22:18.280 --> 22:19.480
Mr. Wakabayashi !

22:19.800 --> 22:22.120
- A friend of your mom's ?
- He lives to our left.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.840
We introduced
ourselves this afternoon.

22:24.120 --> 22:26.280
He said he lost his house
in the storm. Like us.

22:27.800 --> 22:30.400
- Good evening !
- Nice meeting you earlier.

22:32.840 --> 22:35.400
The real estate agent who helped me
find this place had mentioned

22:35.600 --> 22:38.800
that a poor old woman and her son
live in the unit to the right of you.

22:38.920 --> 22:41.640
Apparently, it's the son
who's been moaning nonstop.

22:41.840 --> 22:44.800
- What ? So it's not a monster ?
- So you've heard the rumors ?

22:45.560 --> 22:46.640
Quiet !

22:46.720 --> 22:50.200
They say he looks pretty strange due
to suffering from a chronic illness.

22:50.560 --> 22:53.640
That's how the monster rumor
got started. Don't worry about it.

22:55.320 --> 22:58.240
- Bye-bye !
- Thank you, that's very kind of you !

22:59.280 --> 23:02.440
- I'm glad that there's no monster.
- What a nice young man.

23:02.920 --> 23:06.480
It's kinda strange, though. I went by
this afternoon to introduce myself

23:06.600 --> 23:08.040
and it seemed like no one was home.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.600
Well, the poor woman
might be hard of hearing.

23:11.000 --> 23:14.240
- Sounded like she's elderly.
- Yeah, that might explain it.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.480
He's making those noises again !

23:26.360 --> 23:30.720
That's not... Don't you think
that sounds more like an old woman ?

23:32.760 --> 23:34.400
There's something
off about her cries !

23:34.560 --> 23:36.920
What if something's wrong ?
What if something happened to her !

23:37.160 --> 23:38.240
Kirie !

23:38.320 --> 23:40.240
Hang on, Kirie !
I'll come with you !

23:40.360 --> 23:41.600
I'll go check on her !

23:43.720 --> 23:44.880
Excuse me, Ma'am ?

23:49.360 --> 23:51.000
Ma'am ? Is everything okay ?

23:52.160 --> 23:55.880
My son... My son is dead !

24:08.760 --> 24:11.040
What'd he look like when you
found him ? The son, I mean.

24:11.880 --> 24:14.120
It's not my place to share
those details with you.

24:14.680 --> 24:16.960
I took a quick peek through
the back window a minute ago.

24:18.000 --> 24:20.600
There were little holes in the floor
where the son would have slept.

24:21.040 --> 24:22.240
I couldn't count how many !

24:24.360 --> 24:26.000
What do you think
could have caused them ?

24:26.320 --> 24:28.760
I really don't know.
I said I don't want to talk about it.

24:44.280 --> 24:48.000
Kirie... What a beautiful,
strong-willed woman you are.

24:48.640 --> 24:50.280
I can't take my eyes off of you.

25:06.360 --> 25:07.840
What the heck are those ?

25:28.000 --> 25:29.160
Wakabayashi ?!

26:06.000 --> 26:07.080
Sis !

26:08.000 --> 26:09.120
What is that ?!

26:10.480 --> 26:11.640
Yamaguchi ?!

26:27.320 --> 26:29.000
A spring's sticking out
of his body !

26:36.440 --> 26:38.560
I think that's from
a suspension for a car !

27:55.280 --> 27:57.920
These strange events
kept happening...

27:58.680 --> 28:01.000
Affecting our town
and all of us within it.

28:01.720 --> 28:04.080
Looking back on it...
By that point,

28:04.720 --> 28:06.760
I had already become
numb to everything.
